OL,3,GNEWSA'My boss saved my life that day'
OL,4,
OL,5,FWhen health lecturer Karen Pyle had
OL,6,Fwhat she thought was indigestion she
OL,7,Fdismissed her symptoms as being down to
OL,8,F"something she ate".
OL,10,FBut Pyle's "indigestion" was actually a
OL,11,Fheart attack and it was at that point a
OL,12,F999 emergency call should have been
OL,13,Fmade, says Paul Brolly from the North
OL,14,FEast Ambulance Service (NEAS).
OL,16,FA few weeks later she went into cardiac
OL,17,Farrest at work.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
